\title{\Large \textbf{Kinematic-Aware Spatio-Temporal Graph Convolutional Network with Visibility-Guarded $L_2$ Bone Normalization for 3D Hand Skeletal Restoration and Gesture Recognition under Optical Tracking Dropouts}}

