Inferred Kinematic Mask $\hat{\mathbf{V}}$ (F1 $=96.1\%$, No GT $\mathbf{V}$) & $5.68 \pm 0.28$ & $2.84 \pm 0.14$ & $92.15 \pm 0.82$ & \textbf{35 Frames ($>$ RF)} & $36.20 \pm 1.72$ & $28.45 \pm 1.32$ & $76.80\%$ & $45.2\%$ \\
