\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Funding:} This research project was financially supported by the Faculty of Informatics, Mahasarakham University.
    \item \textbf{Conflict of Interest:} The author declares no conflict of interest.
    \item \textbf{Ethical Approval and Informed Consent:} This study utilizes exclusively publicly available, fully anonymized 3D skeletal benchmark datasets (SHREC'17, FPHA, LMDHG, and Dual-LMC2 ML2HP). No new human subjects were recruited, and no personally identifiable data were collected by the author; therefore, additional institutional review board (IRB) approval was not required.
    \item \textbf{Author's Contributions:} The sole author conceived the study, designed the methodology, implemented the software pipeline, conducted the experiments, performed the statistical analysis, and wrote the manuscript.
