    \item \textbf{Data and Code Availability:} The source code, KAR-Bench Studio software suite, 7-Stage Scientific Evidence Validation Pipeline (\texttt{dataset\_manifest.csv}, \texttt{subject\_split\_manifest.csv}, \texttt{reference\_quality\_report.csv}, \texttt{causality\_test.py}, \texttt{seed\_results.csv}, \texttt{verify\_tables.py}, \texttt{statistical\_validation.ipynb}, \texttt{robustness\_matrix.csv}, and \texttt{deployment\_benchmark.csv}), and benchmark protocols are publicly available at \url{https://github.com/siripornp-msu/KAR-STGCN-3D-Hand-Restoration} (Release Tag \texttt{v2.0.0}).
